  <!-- Engineering Notes -->
  (text "FSR VOLTAGE DIVIDER CIRCUIT NOTES:\n1. 10.0k 0.1% 25ppm metal-film pull-downs provide excellent temperature stability.\n2. 0.1 uF capacitor gives low-pass cutoff fc = 318 Hz, rejecting 20 kHz PWM motor switching hash.\n3. TVS diodes prevent ESD from static build-up on fingertip touch from damaging ESP32 inputs."
